为发丝勾勒出淡淡的发光轮廓，明暗过渡柔和自然。\n拍摄角度解析：低角度仰角拍摄。\n构图风格要素：三分构图法，人物面部落在画面上三分区域，右侧蔷薇花丛形成斜向引导线，从画面右下角花朵延伸至人物侧脸位置。\n \n白色超低胸抹胸露肩洛丽塔裙装，落肩泡泡长袖，袖口带有细腻蕾丝花边，点缀浅粉色缎面蝴蝶结；多层叠戴珍珠颈链，吊坠垂挂一颗水滴造型珍珠；皮肤细腻有光泽。神态温婉柔和，眼眸向上望向斜上方，嘴唇微微张开；右手轻轻抬起，纤细指尖靠近粉色蔷薇花朵，肩膀舒展打开，身体微微向后仰，脸颊凑近花丛，与蔷薇花朵近距离互动。\n \n户外花园环境，背景是茂密繁盛的粉色蔷薇花墙，大量层层叠叠的粉色蔷薇花朵搭配翠绿叶片，花叶数量丰富浓密；前景少量虚化蔷薇枝叶，背景层次丰富，自然户外露天场景。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 334, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [535], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [551.278564453125, 108], "pos": [382.5785217285156, 851.240966796875], "widgets_values": ["一张写实的摄影作品。主体是年轻美丽的亚洲女性。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 332, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "NOISE", "links": [563], "label": "NOISE", "type": "NOISE", "localized_name": "NOISE"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [1236.6776123046875, 1787.132568359375], "widgets_values": [907021539241469, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "noise_seed"}, "name": "noise_seed", "label": "noise_seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "noise_seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 344, "type": "RandomNoise", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RandomNoise"}, "order": 10}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "KKvideo_latentpreview": false, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "favoritedWidgets": {"favorites": []}, "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-125.29972215544373, -1254.3929064571557], "scale": 0.9646149